menu "Xiaomi MCA charging support"

config XM_POWER_SUPPLY
	tristate "Xiaomi Mi Charging Architecture"
	help
	  Xiaomi's charging stack.  It replaces the platform's own charging
	  driver with a layered arrangement: hardware drivers underneath, a
	  class layer that hides which part is fitted, and strategies above
	  that decide what the charge should be doing.

	  The parts are separate modules and load in dependency order; this
	  option builds all of them, because none is useful on its own.

	  Say M here to build them as modules.  If unsure, say N.

endmenu
